url: "https://eduexpressint.com/press"
abstract: >-
  Open, CC BY 4.0 global higher-education dataset of 416 verified active universities
  across 12 countries (China (353), Malaysia (15), United Kingdom (8), Finland (6), Hungary (6), South Korea (6), Cyprus (4), Georgia (4), Greece (4), Thailand (4), Croatia (3), Malta (3)),
  1974 degree and language programs, 1609 itemized non-tuition fee rows,
  737 structured university scholarship tracks, a 32-country
  global Bangladesh outbound cost/visa matrix, and 54 Bangladesh-eligible
  flagship national scholarships covering Bangladesh Bank AD Student File rules, statutory visa
  financial proofs, and explicit local-currency tuition benchmarks.
keywords:
